"varslot, or set it to a fixed string such as \"x\". This is required."
msgstr "<i>xvar</i>: naziv varijable podataka. Možete je povezati s utorom za varijablu ili postaviti fiksni niz poput „x”. Ovo je obavezno."

#. i18n: i18n: "true", "false", and terms inside <i></i> or <b></b> should not be translated, here
#. i18n: ectx: (Loaded from Barplot Options) <technical>
#: rkward/plugins/distributions/../plots/barplot_embed.rkh:36
#, kde-format
